devnet (1.3.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial native Linux release.
  * Split tunneling for networks, hosts, domains and country ranges.
  * DNS presets for systemd-resolved, NetworkManager and resolv.conf.
  * Cloudflare speed test, live latency and local dev-server manager.
  * Tray icon, compact panel, global shortcut and scoped polkit helper.

